# Copy to .env (mobile/.env) - Expo loads it by itself, no command-line variable needed. Restart `npx expo start` after changing it.
# In development you normally do NOT need this: the app finds the API on the computer that runs `expo start` (port 4000).
# Set it when the API runs somewhere else, and ALWAYS for release builds (use the https address):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:4000
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.org
